{"id":"437437","name":"夜开花咸肉粉丝汤","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"","cover":"images/437437/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"夜开花","amount":"1根"},{"name":"粉丝","amount":"50克"},{"name":"咸肉","amount":"60克"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：夜开花。","img":"images/437437/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"粉丝（已泡软）。","img":"images/437437/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"咸肉（已清洗）。","img":"images/437437/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"将咸肉放在案板上切成片，待用。","img":"images/437437/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"将夜开花去皮清洗一下。","img":"images/437437/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放在案板上切成片，待用。","img":"images/437437/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"随后，将切好的咸肉下入清水锅中煮开。","img":"images/437437/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"接着，合入切好的夜开花煮开，煮至夜开花断生变软。","img":"images/437437/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"然后，合入已泡软的粉丝煮开。","img":"images/437437/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"最后，加适量的盐、鸡精调味翻匀，即可。","img":"images/437437/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}